- **Preflight before any cabinet mutate (bump / Settle− / Hold / top-up / revive / Create / status):** read SoT `общее/tgads-кабинет.md` sections **Гигиена портфеля** + **ROMI+ аллокация** + **Settle ↑/↓** + Discovery grid + funnel KPI; in the reply list planned actions with rule cite (or explicitly «исключение: …» if the user overrides). No silent spray of budget/CPM outside those rules; no ROMI≤0 revive/top-up without override. Details stay in the md — this bullet is the gate.
- **Admin gate:** paste `tga_…` into Marketing Panel before Create Ad. `@surfvpn` = `@getSurfVpnBot` (aliases). Export: `python общее/scripts/export_tgads_admin_campaigns.py`.
- **No duplicate Ad title / `start_param`** in cabinet or Связки.
- Destination aliases OK. Title = `tga_{pl}_{cr}_{tx}_{scope}_{slug}_{cab}` (`eur`/`ton`). `?start` same except Search (no tag — don't analyze Search funnel).
- **Per-channel / per-bot testing (current phase):** Channels and Bots ads only with `scope=s` (one `@login` per ad). Do **not** buy via multi-member `c01`/`b01` lists — one click-fraud or fake-MAU bot would poison the whole list and you cannot see which member is dirty from the `tga_` tag. Search `q01` is the exception (queries). Details: `общее/tgads-нейминг.md`.
- Default test: **€5 / €5**, views 1, On Hold. **Volume-first CPM:** start near clearing (channel `scope=s` €3, bots €3.50, search/users €4); if slug already delivered → start = last clearing (round up to 0.50). Safety = daily €5, not a low bid. Details: `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`.
- **Funnel priority:** purchases first, else trials (live). Cheap CPC alone is not a win. Before **scale budget / aggressive CPM** check complex KPI (cold ads): **CTR ≥ 2%**, **s2t ≥ 10%** (trials/starts), **t2b ≥ 7%** (buyers/trials; higher is great). Scale only if all three; Keep if s2t/t2b ok and CTR ≥ 1%; don’t scale if CTR &lt; 1% on volume (techno-type). Kill/Hold: s2t≥10% & 0 buyers (trials≥3–5 or spent≥€10); trials≥5 & t2b&lt;7%; low CTR + weak s2t. Velvet-type low s2t → don’t scale. Details: `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`.
- **CPM bump only for underdelivery** (win auctions / get views), not “quality”. Discovery→Settle: early goal is volume-or-kill, not min CPM; don’t settle down “just in case” in first days. **Never bump** if **views ≥ 300 and clicks = 0** → status `скрутка просмотров` (Hold; nosok-type). Before bump: (1) history of views on this login at other CPMs — if it already delivered cheaper, don’t overbid; (2) fake/MAU signals; (3) last post ≥~3mo → dead, don’t bump. Age from first Active in **Europe/Berlin**. Grid: 0–10 views &lt;~12–24h wait; 0–10 & ≥~12–24h → +€1.50…€2 (cap ~€7–9) else Hold if already €8–9+; 11–49 & ≥~24h → +€0.50 or Hold; 50–99 → +€0.50; 100+ → +€0.25 (mature only). **Discovery hard cap:** 0–10 views and already €8–9+ after the window → **On Hold**, never +another €1–2; don’t Hold in the same pass you just bumped to cap. Review 2×/day: morning Discovery bumps, evening Funnel Keep/Scale/kill. Stopped `daily < daily_spent` on Scale/Keep → raise daily/budget and reactivate. Status reports must include Settle bid actions (↑/↓/hold) + absurd-ceiling flags + **ROMI all** and **ROMI cold** (небренд) with Δ vs previous CSV when available (FX default 95 ₽/€; SoT `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`). **Settle ↑/↓:** on `/ad/…/stats` use eff. CPM (`spent/views×1000`) vs ceiling + views trend + daily pace — underdelivery→bump; fast burn or soft headroom (eff ≤~60–70% ceiling 2–3d, daily survives)→lower (~−20% or ≈eff×1.25–1.4); else don’t touch. **Absurd ceiling:** if eff ≤~50–60% of ceiling (often ceiling ≥~2× eff) on volume → Settle− to ≈eff×1.25–1.4 even on Scale/Keep/**evergreen `getsurfvpnbo`**/Search (Search funnel not analyzed, ceiling still settled). Details: `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`.
- **ROMI+ allocation (current):** revive / top-up / Scale daily only on **per-ad LT ROMI > 0** with buyers ≥ 1 (`(Доход − spent×FX)/(spent×FX)`, FX 95; summary+cabinet). Try Scale on ROMI+ that also hit Scale KPI; Keep (CTR 1–2%) = moderate daily. **ROMI ≤ 0** (even old buyers like sota t01/t04) → no revive/top-up without explicit override. Evergreen own bot/channels: ok to fund; still Settle− absurd ceilings. Use **live** `adsList`/balance for money decisions, not stale `_cab_csv*`. Skip fraud statuses / CTR≥10–15% click≫starts / «не целить». Details: `общее/tgads-кабинет.md` § ROMI на связку.
- **Portfolio hygiene:** low % of sum Active daily-cap ≠ “everyone underdelivers” when many ads have 0 views — judge burn by `daily_spent` / top ads. Safety = test daily €5, not a low bid on cold. Concentrate +budget/+daily on 4–6 **ROMI+** proven Scale/Keep; don’t spray top-ups across lookalike/text-revive with no views/buyers; don’t feed ROMI− by habit. Wide Active book (100+) → morning Discovery, evening Funnel; don’t leave `kill_no_buy` Active past one evening pass without a reason. Sota/techno-type (CTR 1–2%, funnel ok) = Keep, not Scale, until CTR ≥ 2%.
- **Bots:** before Create check t.me MAU + **Telemetr dynamics of related channel** (1-day sub spike = fake) + family notes in Слаги/Связки; Telemetr rarely has bot MAU series — absolute MAU ≠ live. High MAU + ~0 views ≥1d → `накрученный бот`. Sibling «не целить» → skip the bot too. YouTube in ad text = blacklist. Evergreen own-bot (`getsurfvpnbo`): cold Scale KPI thresholds don’t kill it; **do** Settle− absurd ceilings; don’t run Discovery bump ladder on it without a command.
